{
  "schema": "render-view-oracles/v1",
  "id": "render-view-oracles-v1",
  "description": "RFC 0016 K0 frozen view oracles and per-draw state fixtures (tools/render/view_oracle.py). Each scenario boots one map on the native Vulkan client headless (portal_boot.py), places the camera per shot and screenshots; the backend records the frame's views and draws (source-view-oracle/v1, -vieworacle) and its per-draw state (source-draw-state/v1, -drawstatefixture). Determinism: host_framerate fixes the step; -deterministicrender fixes particle seeds and the world's static batch order and seeds the shared random stream with 0 (as -random_invariant); -nosound keeps scripted scenes from waiting on real-time sound playback; noclip and a camera re-placed right before each screenshot keep the view still. Coverage notes: no Portal map has a Water material, a point_camera or a func_monitor, so water reflection and refraction come from Portal 2 (sp_a1_wakeup), and the Portal monitor shots spawn a point_camera (the client's DrawMonitors renders every active point_camera into _rt_Camera). The Portal 2 client in this tree compiles monitors out (viewrender.cpp defines USE_MONITORS only for HL2_CLIENT_DLL and CSTRIKE_DLL, and client_portal2.vpc defines neither), so no Portal 2 map renders a monitor view; retail Portal 2 does (sp_a4_intro's Wheatley monitors).",
  "common": {
    "renderer": "core",
    "physics": "vphysics_box3d",
    "size": [
      1024,
      768
    ],
    "engine_args": [
      "-deterministicrender",
      "-nosound"
    ],
    "startup_commands": [
      "host_framerate 0.015"
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "portal_testchmb_a_00",
      "game": "portal",
      "map": "testchmb_a_00",
      "why": "K0 map. The relaxation vault's frosted glass; two portals opened in the second room facing each other, so every recursion depth up to the limit is visible; the legacy-ports view set at the spawn point; a spawned point_camera, linked (info_camera_link) to the blue portal so the server activates it while the portal is in the PVS, for the monitor view (no Portal map has one).",
      "intro_frames": 2400,
      "setup": [
        "noclip",
        "ent_create prop_portal targetname vo_blue LinkageGroupID 7 PortalTwo 0",
        "ent_create prop_portal targetname vo_orange LinkageGroupID 7 PortalTwo 1",
        "ent_fire vo_blue NewLocation \"-960 -560 630 0 180 0\" 1",
        "ent_fire vo_orange NewLocation \"-1140 -560 630 0 0 0\" 1",
        "ent_fire vo_blue SetActivatedState 1 2",
        "ent_fire vo_orange SetActivatedState 1 2",
        "ent_create point_camera targetname vo_cam",
        "ent_fire vo_cam AddOutput \"origin -1100 -560 660\" 1",
        "ent_fire vo_cam AddOutput \"angles 10 0 0\" 1",
        "ent_create info_camera_link targetname vo_camlink target vo_blue PointCamera vo_cam",
        "ent_fire vo_cam SetOff 2"
      ],
      "shots": [
        {
          "view_set": "legacy-ports",
          "camera": [
            -608,
            -347,
            161
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "glass_vault",
          "features": [
            "glass"
          ],
          "commands": [
            "cmd setpos -538 -367 161",
            "cmd setang 4 -172 0"
          ],
          "settle": 30,
          "expect": {
            "materials": [
              "glass"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "recursion_limit1",
          "features": [
            "portal_recursion"
          ],
          "commands": [
            "r_portal_stencil_depth 1",
            "cmd setpos -1088 -560 580",
            "cmd setang 0 0 0"
          ],
          "settle": 20,
          "expect": {
            "nested_depth": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "recursion_limit2",
          "features": [
            "portal_recursion"
          ],
          "commands": [
            "r_portal_stencil_depth 2",
            "cmd setpos -1088 -560 580",
            "cmd setang 0 0 0"
          ],
          "settle": 20,
          "expect": {
            "nested_depth": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "recursion_limit10",
          "features": [
            "portal_recursion"
          ],
          "commands": [
            "r_portal_stencil_depth 10",
            "cmd setpos -1088 -560 580",
            "cmd setang 0 0 0"
          ],
          "settle": 20,
          "expect": {
            "nested_depth": 10
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "monitor",
          "features": [
            "monitor"
          ],
          "commands": [
            "ent_fire vo_cam SetOn",
            "cmd setpos -1088 -560 580",
            "cmd setang 0 0 0"
          ],
          "settle": 30,
          "post": [
            "ent_fire vo_cam SetOff"
          ],
          "expect": {
            "kinds": {
              "monitor": 1
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
